      "id": "claim_964c472213a245bcac24933658362e88",
      "statement": "packages/mcp-shared/src/tools.ts is the single place an MCP server's tool annotations are read: classifyTool treats readOnlyHint===true as a read (observation) and everything else as an action for the approval queue, with every annotation test a strict === comparison so an unannotated tool can never auto-apply on either trust tier.",
