    {
      "id": "claim_d11f0fc00ace4f428b259dfae7645bc8",
      "statement": "Every outbound MCP request goes through mcp-shared's fetch: redirects are followed by hand and re-checked at each hop (max 3) with Authorization dropped when a hop leaves the original origin, one 30-second default deadline covers redirects/pagination/streaming/retries, response bodies are buffered whole under a 1 MiB cap, and MCP_ALLOW_INSECURE (defaulting to \"false\" in both connectors' wrangler configs) is the single dev-only escape hatch for plain HTTP and private hosts.",
      "evidence": [
