      "statement": "The MCP connectors' resource bounds are fixed rather than configurable (per mcp-shared/README.md): 200 tools per server, 96 KiB catalog, 50 tools/list pages, 1 MiB response bodies, 128 KiB retained results, 100 retained actions, 50 pending decisions, 600-char tool descriptions and 4000-char arguments in prompts, 3 redirect hops, 10-minute connect links, 1-hour unfinished-connect cleanup, and a 30-second outbound deadline.",
